; HYDRAULIC PUNISHER (design rulings 3-4): one hidden reaction that watches every Prone landing on the
; map and, when the Gloire was the one who knocked a hostile down, hangs buff_hydraulic_punisher on
; them - the buff IS the Impaired (applies_statuses) and drops itself when they clear Prone. No
; passive, no pressable: the Kit's only player-facing surface is its card. SP3: one glyph family,
; shared with buff_hydraulic_punisher's chip.
